  "task": {
    "title": "O‘z saytingizning kontaktlar sahifasi",
    "language": "html",
    "description": "O‘z klubingiz, to‘garagingiz yoki kutubxonangizning contact.html sahifasini yasang (Azizning portfoliosini emas): viewport va description li to‘liq head; #main havolasi va main id=\"main\"; index.html, about.html, projects.html, contact.html ga menyuli header; bitta h1; caption va scope col/row li jadval; fieldset, legend, label li ikkita maydon (bittasi email) va button type=\"submit\" li method=\"get\" forma; footer.",
    "starter_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"uz\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <!-- viewport, title, description -->\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- «Asosiy mazmunga o‘tish» havolasi -->\n    <!-- menyuli header: index.html, about.html, projects.html, contact.html -->\n    <!-- main id=\"main\": h1, jadval (caption, scope col va row), forma (fieldset, legend, label li 2 maydon, bittasi email, button submit) -->\n    <!-- footer -->\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "rules": {
      "required": [
        "<!DOCTYPE html>",
        "<html lang=\"",
        "<meta charset=\"utf-8\"",
        "name=\"viewport\"",
        "name=\"description\"",
        "<title>",
        "<header",
        "<nav",
        "<footer",
        "id=\"main\"",
        "<caption",
        "<fieldset",
        "<legend",
        "method=\"get\""
      ],
      "forbidden": [
        "<div",
        "role=\"button\"",
        "tabindex=\"1\"",
        "tabindex=\"2\"",
        "tabindex=\"3\"",
        "href=\"c:",
        "Азиз",
        "aziz"
      ],
      "tags": {
        "table": 1,
        "th": 3,
        "label": 2,
        "input": 2,
        "li": 4
      },
      "href_targets": [
        "#main",
        "index.html",
        "about.html",
        "projects.html",
        "contact.html"
      ],
      "scope_values": [
        "col",
        "row"
      ],
      "input_types": [
        "email"
      ],
      "for_id_pairs": true,
      "button_submit": true,
      "h1_exact": 1
    },
    "hints": [
      "head da: charset, viewport, o‘z title va description ingiz.",
      "body ning birinchi qatori: <a href=\"#main\">Asosiy mazmunga o‘tish</a>; main da - id=\"main\".",
      "4 sahifali menyu: index.html, about.html, projects.html, contact.html.",
      "Jadval: caption, sarlavha qatorida th scope=\"col\", qatorlar boshida th scope=\"row\".",
      "Forma: method=\"get\", fieldset + legend, label for = id, type=\"email\", <button type=\"submit\">.",
      "Mavzu - o‘zingizniki: klub, to‘garak, kutubxona. Namuna matnini ko‘chirmang."
    ],
    "solution": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"uz\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Kontaktlar - «Ruh» shaxmat klubi</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"«Ruh» shaxmat klubi bilan qanday bog‘lanish: ish vaqti, telefon va sinov mashg‘ulotiga yozilish formasi.\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <a href=\"#main\">Asosiy mazmunga o‘tish</a>\n    <header>\n        <p>«Ruh» shaxmat klubi</p>\n        <nav>\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"index.html\">Bosh sahifa</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"about.html\">Klub haqida</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"projects.html\">Turnirlar</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"contact.html\">Kontaktlar</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n    <main id=\"main\">\n        <h1>Kontaktlar</h1>\n        <table>\n            <caption>Klubning ish vaqti</caption>\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th scope=\"col\">Kun</th>\n                    <th scope=\"col\">Vaqt</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <th scope=\"row\">Seshanba</th>\n                    <td>16:00-19:00</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <th scope=\"row\">Shanba</th>\n                    <td>10:00-14:00</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <section>\n            <h2>Sinov mashg‘ulotiga yozilish</h2>\n            <p>O‘quv forma: ma’lumotlar sahifa manzilida paydo bo‘ladi va hech qayerga yuborilmaydi.</p>\n            <form method=\"get\">\n                <fieldset>\n                    <legend>Ma’lumotlaringiz</legend>\n                    <p>\n                        <label for=\"name\">Ism</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required>\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        <label for=\"email\">Pochta</label>\n                        <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" required>\n                    </p>\n                </fieldset>\n                <p><button type=\"submit\">Yozilish</button></p>\n            </form>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer>\n        <p><small>&copy; 2026 «Ruh» shaxmat klubi</small></p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
